Homepage: https://github.com/thruput-io/gettoken
Description: token broker for AI agents
 An agent that holds a long-lived credential holds whatever authority that
 credential carries, and an agent can be talked into things by whatever it
 reads. gettoken hands an agent a token narrow enough for the job in front of
 it and nothing more, drawn from a super-token a human already holds.
 .
 This package contains the entry point the agent invokes and the privileged
 half that builds the request on its behalf. The agent never holds the
 super-token: it says what it wants, and gets back a token for that job.
Commands: gettoken

