Description: token broker for AI agents - the exchanger the tool integrates
 The exchanger integrationtest/ci/run is served by. It is told who is asking and
 what for, trades the super-token the store holds for a narrow one, and answers
 with that.
 .
 It is a separate package from the tool because it is on the other side of the
 boundary: the tool is a public name an agent runs, and this is run by
 token-service with the super-token in reach. What each may be told is what each
 depends on, and they are not the same.

